# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output & aden artifacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
# ADR-003: the rebuildable graph store/caches now live in the per-user data dir,
# never in-tree. Ignore any legacy in-tree rebuildable artifacts, but TRACK the
# durable, repo-coupled intent meant to travel with the repository (overlays,
# constitution, hooks, the persisted project root).
**/.aden/store/
**/.aden/cache/
**/.aden/gen-cache.json
**/.aden/scan-cache.json
**/.aden/staging/
# Legacy on-disk contracts (aden is now store-first and emits no .adoc; these
# remain as a safety net in case an old/in-tree generation ever runs).
**/contracts/
crates/**/*.adoc
benches/**/*.adoc
src/**/*.adoc
# Generated stub .adoc mirrors of real .md/.ts files. A stray gen/heal once
# committed STUB placeholders alongside (e.g. README.adoc next to README.md) and
# overwrote hand-authored .agent docs. Ignore the locations where .adoc is NEVER
# hand-authored. Real docs live in docs/*.adoc and .agent/*.adoc (NOT ignored).
/*.adoc
research/**/*.adoc
editors/**/*.adoc
# Cargo.lock is committed at the workspace root for CI reproducibility.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Agent / tooling runtime (never commit local state, settings, or locks)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.opencode/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & credentials — NEVER commit these.
# Kept in lockstep with aden_core::filter::is_secret_path so the repo refuses
# exactly what aden refuses to index. If aden becomes widely used, this is the
# safety net that keeps a careless `git add .` from leaking a key.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# dotenv & ecosystem credential files
.env
.env.*
.envrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
_netrc
.htpasswd
credentials
credentials.*
service-account*.json
# private keys / keystores / encrypted secrets
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
*.kdbx
*.ppk
*.asc
*.gpg
*.pgp
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
# public keys are fine to share; keep an explicit allow for placeholders
*.pub
!tools/keys/.gitkeep
# credential-bearing directories
.ssh/
.gnupg/
.aws/
.azure/
.kube/
.docker/config.json
secrets/
secret/
private/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated signing artifacts (public material OK, private NO)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/signatures/
*.sig
asc/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Polyglot build / dependency output (aden targets any repo; if one is nested
# here for testing, don't accidentally vendor it in)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/
out/
vendor/
.gradle/
.cache/
coverage/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor / OS debris
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*.temp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local scratch
.claude-tmp/
